id:                     E545
trigger_tool:           test|runtime|cmake
phase:                  testing|runtime
error_signature:        Error loading shared library libKDSoapWSDiscoveryClient\.so|Error relocating .*test_wsdiscoveryclient.*symbol not found
severity:               2
category:               cmake, build-system, linking, testing, ohos
match_keywords:         KDECMakeSettings, ECM, CMake, build/Release/bin, LD_LIBRARY_PATH, CTest, Conan, shared library
title:                  KDE CMake 测试运行前须将 build/bin 加入动态库搜索路径
root_cause:             HarmonyOS 上 KDE/ECM CMake 配置将构建树中的共享库和可执行文件放在 build/Release/bin；Conan 配方仅把 build/Release/lib 加入 LD_LIBRARY_PATH，导致 CTest 启动测试程序时找不到刚生成的共享库并报告其符号无法重定位。
affected_scope:         使用 KDE KDECMakeSettings/ECM 且关闭 RPATH、在 Conan build() 中直接运行 CTest 的 HarmonyOS CMake 库配方。
verification_cmd:       find build/Release -name 'libKDSoapWSDiscoveryClient.so*'; LD_LIBRARY_PATH=build/Release/bin:$LD_LIBRARY_PATH ctest --test-dir build/Release --output-on-failure --no-tests=error
rec_priority:           1
rec_approach:           runtime-path-build-bin
rec_description:        从实际链接输出定位共享库目录，并在 CTest 期间将 build_folder/bin 与依赖包 lib 目录加入 LD_LIBRARY_PATH。
rec_command:            LD_LIBRARY_PATH=$BUILD_FOLDER/bin:$QT_LIB:$KDSOAP_LIB:$LD_LIBRARY_PATH ctest --test-dir $BUILD_FOLDER --output-on-failure --no-tests=error
rec_auto_fix:           false
rec_impl:               manual-edit
fallback_priority:      2
fallback_approach:      cmake-build-rpath
fallback_description:   若测试环境不允许设置运行环境变量，可为构建树目标配置指向其实际输出目录的 BUILD_RPATH；发布包仍应关闭构建路径 RPATH。
fallback_command:       cmake -S . -B build -DCMAKE_BUILD_RPATH=bin
fallback_auto_fix:      false
fallback_impl:          manual-edit
forbid_1_pattern:       patchelf.*(build/Release/bin|KDSoapWSDiscoveryClient)|CMAKE_INSTALL_RPATH.*BUILD_FOLDER
forbid_1_reason:        构建树测试缺少库搜索路径不应靠修改已签名 ELF 或把构建目录写入可发布产物的 RPATH 修补。
forbid_1_consequence:   可能破坏 HarmonyOS ELF 签名，或将机器专属构建路径泄漏到 Conan 包。
principles:             []
causes:                 []
caused_by:              []
similar_to:             []
conflicts_with:         []
prerequisite_of:        []
doc_file:               knowledge/drafts/E545-draft-KDSC.md
last_updated:           2026-10-11
source_event:           kdsoap-ws-discovery-client 0.4.0 G2 真实运行失败：CTest 找不到 build/Release/bin/libKDSoapWSDiscoveryClient.so.0；修正构建树运行环境的库搜索目录
